                ],
                "translations": [
                    {
                        "translation_id": "3e738f1f-ab6f-416b-8f27-02141997341b",
                        "source_entry_id": "224dc29c-d9a7-33d3-b7c8-12cc479e9ebe",
                        "source_sense_id": "faa6bda1-9872-357d-b441-231bbf2ce335",
                        "target_lang_word": "inconvenience",
                        "target_lang_code": "en",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "inconvenience",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "ce970598-380f-3241-81ec-850a51512c3b",
                                        "entry_id": "5dc563a2-27ec-3e15-9e73-13d0ae89f984",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "The quality of being inconvenient."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "fde8fdac-5033-4212-9e96-f2e928c611e1",
                                                "sense_id": "ce970598-380f-3241-81ec-850a51512c3b",
                                                "text": "They plead against the inconvenience, not the unlawfulness, […] of ceremonies in burial."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "8729b5a9-581b-39f2-9443-154508943127",
                                        "entry_id": "5dc563a2-27ec-3e15-9e73-13d0ae89f984",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Something that is not convenient, something that bothers."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [
                                            "countable",
                                            "uncountable"
                                        ],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "eb9e191b-7f83-4560-adea-142cf0c01330",
                                                "sense_id": "8729b5a9-581b-39f2-9443-154508943127",
                                                "text": "[Man] is liable to a great many inconveniences."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "2cd8da19-92e5-4fa2-a9f7-0089a60ff36f",
                                                "sense_id": "8729b5a9-581b-39f2-9443-154508943127",
                                                "text": "The inconveniences that must be endured before the modernisation plan can come into action may be seen at Coventry, where since August the station has been in the throes of rebuilding."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a8c8c1e9-3326-4f1d-a25f-8267efa3d93c",
                                                "sense_id": "8729b5a9-581b-39f2-9443-154508943127",
                                                "text": "An artificial kidney […] can cause bleeding, clotting and infection—not to mention inconvenience for patients, who typically need to be hooked up to one three times a week for hours at a time."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            },
                            {
                                "target_word": "inconvenience",
                                "target_lang_code": "en",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7c202815-51d5-3c3e-9b15-b631ec05ac5d",
                                        "entry_id": "30ea56cf-35cb-3e38-a92e-08e0a80c8372",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "To bother; to discomfort."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "358da721-c7a2-424e-9d9b-7e5b9167a1a8",
                                                "sense_id": "7c202815-51d5-3c3e-9b15-b631ec05ac5d",
                                                "text": "He declared that these drastic steps would undoubtedly inconvenience a good many people, but the alternative was bankruptcy of the Ulster Transport Authority and the breakdown of public transport services."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "translation_id": "9db8f5f6-829a-4e32-b735-85c4d084a687",
                        "source_entry_id": "224dc29c-d9a7-33d3-b7c8-12cc479e9ebe",
                        "source_sense_id": "faa6bda1-9872-357d-b441-231bbf2ce335",
                        "target_lang_word": "inconfort",
                        "target_lang_code": "fr",
                        "target_sense_ids": [],
                        "cross_references": [
                            {
                                "target_word": "inconfort",
                                "target_lang_code": "fr",
                                "target_senses": [
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "7bafbeaf-bfba-314e-80a8-78fbda8f7aaf",
                                        "entry_id": "80cbe1a7-42ee-316b-acf1-4713eacc2f81",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "Absence de confort."
                                        ],
                                        "tags": [],
                                        "examples": [
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "dc72c510-de14-4b58-830f-3f81e5078745",
                                                "sense_id": "7bafbeaf-bfba-314e-80a8-78fbda8f7aaf",
                                                "text": "Contrairement à beaucoup d’érudits en chambre, notre confrère profitait de ses inspections communales pour mener ses enquêtes sociologiques ou folkloriques sur le terrain, souvent dans des conditions d’inconfort inimaginables."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "bf07a130-57e9-4092-9206-e6a6289adaae",
                                                "sense_id": "7bafbeaf-bfba-314e-80a8-78fbda8f7aaf",
                                                "text": "À l'instant, je me sens au milieu de nulle part. C'est une sensation de malaise indescriptible, un inconfort inqualifiable."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "599f1d54-4cb0-4d2b-b551-0358fc5c72f0",
                                                "sense_id": "7bafbeaf-bfba-314e-80a8-78fbda8f7aaf",
                                                "text": "L’Association du Barreau canadien (ABC), organisme où milite un très grand nombre de candidats à la magistrature pour faire preuve d’« engagement » dans la communauté, a manifesté son inconfort dans deux communiqués récents."
                                            },
                                            {
                                                "example_id": "a92030dc-b398-4931-bccd-0b6f80ded706",
                                                "sense_id": "7bafbeaf-bfba-314e-80a8-78fbda8f7aaf",
                                                "text": "La clim est « un fort vecteur d’inégalités entre les groupes sociaux. Pour le confort de quelques-uns, elle va augmenter l’ inconfort de l’ensemble de la population » en augmentant le réchauffement à l’extérieur, dans les endroits partagés, commente Géraldine Molina."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    }
                                ]
                            }
                        ]
                    },
